@node Overview
@chapter Overview

@samp{jinx-extras.el} extends the @samp{jinx} package@comma{} a fast spell-checking
framework that uses external checkers such as Hunspell or Aspell.
While Jinx handles detection and correction of misspellings@comma{} this
extension adds two conveniences that the base package does not provide:

@itemize
@item
@strong{Abbreviation learning}: every time you correct a misspelling
through Jinx@comma{} the typo/correction pair is saved as a
@code{text-mode-abbrev-table} entry so that Emacs will auto-correct the
same typo in the future (@ref{Abbreviation learning, , Abbreviation learning}).
@item
@strong{Language toggling}: a single command to switch Jinx between English
and Spanish@comma{} useful for bilingual writers
(@ref{Toggling languages, , Toggling languages}).
@end itemize

